WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.480 --> 00:00:06.320
Hi, Mystery Recapped here. Today I am&nbsp;
going to explain a comedy film called&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:06.320 --> 00:00:11.440
“Sixty Million Dollar Man.” Spoilers&nbsp;
ahead! Watch out and take care!
&nbsp;

00:00:15.680 --> 00:00:21.520
Sing is a spoiled rich youngster living in Hawaii.&nbsp;
He has a dozen servants who bring him breakfast in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:21.520 --> 00:00:28.000
bed, help him take shower, and dress him up every&nbsp;
day. His life is unlike anyone else’s as he has a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:33.600
very peculiar way of doing normal things; for&nbsp;
instance, he only gargles with fresh cow milk,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:33.600 --> 00:00:39.200
only takes a bath in his swimming pool with a&nbsp;
bunch of women, and only travels in a helicopter.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:39.200 --> 00:00:44.720
Tat is Sing’s personal assistant who manages&nbsp;
everything in Sing’s life. Because Sing has always&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:44.720 --> 00:00:50.080
gotten everything he wanted, he has developed&nbsp;
a hobby of troubling everyone around him. 
&nbsp;

00:00:50.080 --> 00:00:55.600
One morning, Tat and Sing board a helicopter to&nbsp;
fly to Sing’s college. All the students in the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:55.600 --> 00:01:00.640
college know him as the spoiled brat who plays&nbsp;
silly pranks. Still, because of his father’s&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:00.640 --> 00:01:06.880
influence, no one dares to go against him. Sing’s&nbsp;
usual target is the school loner named Siu-Fu.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:06.880 --> 00:01:12.320
He breaks the toilet’s wall when Siu-Fu is&nbsp;
inside it to humiliate him in front of everyone.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:12.320 --> 00:01:17.680
The poor guy bawls his eyes out and runs away&nbsp;
naked and embarrassed. As Sing and Tat laugh at&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:17.680 --> 00:01:22.960
yet another successful prank, they are approached&nbsp;
by a new girl named Chung-Chung. Initially,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:22.960 --> 00:01:27.360
she startles Sing because of her ugliness.&nbsp;
He is furious that she got admitted to their&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:27.360 --> 00:01:32.080
college because he had especially told the&nbsp;
principal to only take in beautiful girls&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:32.080 --> 00:01:37.360
with nicer bodies. Chung-Chung reveals that she&nbsp;
is the daughter of the science teacher, Professor&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:37.360 --> 00:01:42.400
Chang. Unlike the others, she isn’t scared of&nbsp;
Sing and his influence. She calls him out for&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:42.400 --> 00:01:47.600
the stupid prank, much to Sing’s annoyance.
Later, during Professor Chang’s class,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:47.600 --> 00:01:53.120
Sing arrives late as usual. The other students&nbsp;
give him space and move further away, except&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:53.120 --> 00:01:58.400
for Chung-Chung who stays put. The professor&nbsp;
overlooks Sing’s ignorant behavior and continues&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:58.400 --> 00:02:03.200
teaching. He talks about a new technology that&nbsp;
will allow people to be turned into cyborgs.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:03.200 --> 00:02:08.160
When he dissects a dead body to show them the&nbsp;
visual representation of the theory, the students&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:08.160 --> 00:02:13.120
can hardly keep themselves from passing out.
During the lunch break, Sing and Tat come to the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:13.120 --> 00:02:18.480
cafeteria and everyone else walks away, afraid&nbsp;
of him. Again, Chung-Chung is the only one who&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:18.480 --> 00:02:24.000
sits right beside him and continues eating. Sing&nbsp;
threatens to get her fired but Professor Chang,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:24.000 --> 00:02:28.800
who is nearby, says that it won’t be possible.&nbsp;
The professor also calls him the most disgusting&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:28.800 --> 00:02:33.120
student he has ever had. If it weren’t for&nbsp;
his father being the director of the college,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:33.120 --> 00:02:37.280
Sing would have been beaten to death by the&nbsp;
people he troubles on the daily. To test if&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:37.280 --> 00:02:41.520
his classmates would really do something like&nbsp;
that, he blurts out that his father is not the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:41.520 --> 00:02:46.000
director of the school. When the other students&nbsp;
hear this, they do not waste their time before&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:46.000 --> 00:02:51.040
piling on top of Sing and beating him up.
Sing is left furious after the incident.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:51.040 --> 00:02:55.840
He and Tat break into the professor’s house at&nbsp;
night to teach him a lesson. They set up bear&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:55.840 --> 00:03:00.320
traps in the basement lab, hoping that the&nbsp;
professor will fall right into it. But then,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:00.320 --> 00:03:05.600
as they are about to leave, Tat notices a&nbsp;
cut-off hand walking on its own. Initially,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:05.600 --> 00:03:11.440
Sing thinks Tat is joking and asks him to focus.&nbsp;
Seconds later, a pair of eyes stares at them,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:11.440 --> 00:03:16.640
startling the two. They struggle to get a hold of&nbsp;
the hand but it runs away into a corner. On trying&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:16.640 --> 00:03:22.000
to pull it out, Sing comes across a half-human&nbsp;
body. The duo thinks they are being haunted by a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:22.000 --> 00:03:28.000
ghost and runs away. On his way out, Tat falls&nbsp;
into the beartrap and hurts his behind. 
&nbsp;

00:03:28.000 --> 00:03:32.960
A while later, they call the police, suspecting&nbsp;
that the professor is conducting experiments by&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:32.960 --> 00:03:38.400
dissecting people’s body parts. The police search&nbsp;
everywhere but cannot find the said pair of eyes&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:38.400 --> 00:03:44.080
or the hand. They think the idea is absurd and&nbsp;
accuse Sing of wasting their time. In the end,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:44.080 --> 00:03:49.040
they evacuate Tat and Sing out of the house.&nbsp;
After everyone leaves, the hand and eyes appear&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:49.040 --> 00:03:53.920
behind the professor, revealing that they&nbsp;
are in fact one of his cyborg experiments.
&nbsp;

00:03:53.920 --> 00:03:58.160
The following day, Sing is paranoid that the&nbsp;
professor will send the body parts to trouble&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:58.160 --> 00:04:03.280
him again. Hence, he dresses up in football gear,&nbsp;
ready to defend himself in case anyone tries to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:03.280 --> 00:04:08.640
harm him. Sing’s father arrives from China to&nbsp;
give him a surprise but is beaten up by his&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:08.640 --> 00:04:13.360
son after being mistaken for an intruder.
Following that, someone knocks on their front&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:13.360 --> 00:04:19.680
door. On checking, Sing finds a seductive woman&nbsp;
named Bonnie, asking him to help her bathe.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:19.680 --> 00:04:24.400
It turns out that she is a neighbor who has been&nbsp;
watching him for a long time. Sing doesn’t miss&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:24.400 --> 00:04:28.800
the chance to take her to his personal swimming&nbsp;
pool where the two clean each other. That night,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:28.800 --> 00:04:34.080
they go to a club and drink a lot. As they are&nbsp;
dancing, Bonnie sees her husband enter the club.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:34.080 --> 00:04:39.840
She reveals that her husband is a local crime&nbsp;
lord named Fumito. The couple tries their best&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:39.840 --> 00:04:44.480
to hide but the organizer of a show announces&nbsp;
them the winner of a dancing competition.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:44.480 --> 00:04:48.560
When the spotlight falls on the couple,&nbsp;
they catch the entire club’s attention.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:48.560 --> 00:04:53.600
Fumito fumes in anger on seeing his wife&nbsp;
with someone else. He and his henchmen bring&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:53.600 --> 00:04:58.560
the two to his house to teach them a lesson.
On reaching home, Sing passes out drunk. Bonnie&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:58.560 --> 00:05:03.520
tries helping him but is knocked out when Sing&nbsp;
suddenly wakes up and hits her. He somehow gets to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:03.520 --> 00:05:09.040
his car and drives away while the gangsters follow&nbsp;
him. On reaching home, Sing is out of breath&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:09.040 --> 00:05:13.920
and terrified. He tries to tell his mother what&nbsp;
happened, but she cuts him off, claiming that she&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:13.920 --> 00:05:20.160
has something more important to say. She confesses&nbsp;
that she slept with Tat twenty years ago. This&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:20.160 --> 00:05:26.000
means that the millionaire businessman Pai is&nbsp;
not actually Sing’s father, but his assistant&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:26.000 --> 00:05:31.120
is. Pai overhears their conversation and calls&nbsp;
his wife a whore. Although he is relieved that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:31.120 --> 00:05:36.720
an ugly guy like Sing is not his biological son,&nbsp;
he is heartbroken by his wife’s betrayal. 
&nbsp;

00:05:36.720 --> 00:05:42.080
Tat also joins the conversation and asks Sing&nbsp;
to stay as his son, now that everyone knows the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:42.080 --> 00:05:48.000
truth. However, Sing wants two million dollars and&nbsp;
is willing to continue being Pai’s son for money.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:48.000 --> 00:05:52.640
Tat is distressed because he has always loved&nbsp;
Sing as family. Sing, on the other hand, kicks&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:52.640 --> 00:05:57.680
him out of the house to receive money from Pai.
He did what he had to in the heat of the moment&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:57.680 --> 00:06:03.280
but the following day, Sing is guilt-ridden. He&nbsp;
always had Tat by his side growing up and after&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:03.280 --> 00:06:08.560
knowing that he is his father, Sing cannot help&nbsp;
but feel sorry. Later that day, he goes to the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:08.560 --> 00:06:14.160
church for self-reflection and finds Chung-Chung.&nbsp;
He tells her what he did yesterday and how bad he&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:14.160 --> 00:06:18.640
feels. Chung-Chung also begins to realize that&nbsp;
he is not as bad as she thought he was. 
&nbsp;

00:06:18.640 --> 00:06:24.480
That evening, the gangster Fumito sends his&nbsp;
right-hand man Mark to kill Sing. They get into a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:24.480 --> 00:06:29.360
chase around the house when suddenly the lights go&nbsp;
off. When they turn back on, we see that Tat has&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:29.360 --> 00:06:34.800
come to save his son. He puts his life in danger&nbsp;
for Sing but the two are caught in the end. Then,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:34.800 --> 00:06:39.920
their hands are cuffed together in a bathroom&nbsp;
stall, where Mark has planted a bomb. After the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:39.920 --> 00:06:45.440
gangsters leave, the father and son only have a&nbsp;
few seconds before the explosive goes off. Sing&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:45.440 --> 00:06:51.280
takes responsibility for the first time and cuts&nbsp;
his arm off so Tat can escape. In the following&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:51.280 --> 00:06:59.840
explosion, Tat survives but Sing passes away. 
The next day Sing’s case is brought to professor&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:59.840 --> 00:07:03.520
Chang. He reveals that although Sing&nbsp;
technically died in the explosion,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:03.520 --> 00:07:09.040
his lips remained unharmed. Using the technology&nbsp;
he has recently been developing, he can reform&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:09.040 --> 00:07:14.960
Sing’s body with artificial parts, keeping only&nbsp;
his lips intact. Tatt speaks to his son’s lips&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:14.960 --> 00:07:20.480
and assures him that he will be fine. However,&nbsp;
the cost of surgery is sixty million dollars.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:20.480 --> 00:07:25.680
Pai calls Sing and asks him to get rid of Tat if&nbsp;
he wants the money for surgery. But Sing has come&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:25.680 --> 00:07:31.360
to his senses, even though he is only a pair of&nbsp;
lips. He renounces his rich father and decides to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:31.360 --> 00:07:37.120
stay dead not wanting to abandon Tat again.
Tat begs the professor to perform the surgery&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:37.120 --> 00:07:42.000
using the six thousand dollars that he has. Chang&nbsp;
feels bad for the desperate father and agrees to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:42.000 --> 00:07:47.200
perform the procedure. But, the results won’t be&nbsp;
as good, as he will have to makeshift the body&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:47.200 --> 00:07:53.040
parts with whatever things he has. Following that,&nbsp;
the professor spends days and nights aggressively&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:53.040 --> 00:07:58.240
pinching and pushing the body. For the first&nbsp;
few tries, many things go wrong. Sometimes,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:58.240 --> 00:08:03.120
Sing wakes up with a square head, sometimes,&nbsp;
with a tiny hand, and the other times with hands&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:03.120 --> 00:08:09.280
attached to his lower body instead of legs. 
Then, a few weeks later, everything works out and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:09.280 --> 00:08:14.640
Sing is turned back to his older self with&nbsp;
makeshift body parts. Since he is now a cyborg,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:14.640 --> 00:08:19.680
his body runs on a battery that can die at any&nbsp;
time. Sing has to be careful with his life but he&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:19.680 --> 00:08:24.800
is overjoyed to finally be back alive. While the&nbsp;
professor could find an alternative for all of his&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:24.800 --> 00:08:31.200
body parts, finding a male genital was impossible.&nbsp;
Hence, currently, Sing has a faucet that helps him&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:31.200 --> 00:08:38.800
pee. In the following scene, a funeral is held for&nbsp;
Sing so the gangsters won’t look for him again.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:38.800 --> 00:08:43.920
No one comes to the funeral except for&nbsp;
Chung-Chung who is genuinely sad about his death.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:43.920 --> 00:08:48.000
Sing sees her from afar and is happy&nbsp;
that at least someone cares about him.
&nbsp;

00:08:48.000 --> 00:08:53.440
Cut to two years later. Sing currently lives with&nbsp;
his father and has been looking for a job. He eats&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:53.440 --> 00:08:58.480
batteries for every meal and has changed his&nbsp;
genitals to a shower head instead of a faucet.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:58.480 --> 00:09:03.520
One day, his college classmate Siu-Fu offers&nbsp;
him a job as a teacher in a school. 
&nbsp;

00:09:03.520 --> 00:09:08.400
Sing is overjoyed that he finally gets to earn&nbsp;
money for himself but little does he know, he is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:08.400 --> 00:09:13.840
about to face the worst students in the country.&nbsp;
On his first day at work, he is instantly attacked&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:13.840 --> 00:09:18.480
with buckets full of water and paintballs.&nbsp;
His fellow teacher saves him from the attack&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:18.480 --> 00:09:22.960
and brings him to a safer place. He reveals that&nbsp;
fifty percent of the teachers who have come to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:22.960 --> 00:09:28.960
teach these students have resigned in only a day.&nbsp;
The rest have either turned into handicaps, died,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:28.960 --> 00:09:34.800
or gone crazy. With a renewed motivation to be&nbsp;
the most strict teacher possible, Sing enters a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:34.800 --> 00:09:40.400
classroom. He shows the students a knife to assert&nbsp;
his dominance but the youngsters trap him in a net&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:40.400 --> 00:09:45.040
and throw their bags at him. The principal of the&nbsp;
school doesn’t care because the students are the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:45.040 --> 00:09:50.000
children of power and wealthy businessmen. 
By the end of the day, Sing is heavily beaten&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:50.000 --> 00:09:55.040
up and crucified to the school’s gate with&nbsp;
his showerhead hanging out. All of a sudden,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:55.040 --> 00:10:00.400
Chung-Chung appears and recognizes him. She has&nbsp;
turned into a beautiful and confident girl, in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:00.400 --> 00:10:06.400
contrast to how she was before. She tries to help&nbsp;
but Sing smugly claims that he can do it himself.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:06.400 --> 00:10:11.040
Moments later, she gets into a sports car&nbsp;
with her rich boyfriend and drives away,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:11.040 --> 00:10:15.040
much to Sing’s disappointment.
That night at home, Sing has lost all&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:15.040 --> 00:10:18.160
hopes. When he is about to give up on life, the&nbsp;
professor comes to meet him and discloses that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:18.160 --> 00:10:23.520
he has invented a chip that will turn Sing into&nbsp;
a superhero. Basically, with the help of the said&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:23.520 --> 00:10:29.040
chip, he will be able to transform into anything.&nbsp;
Sing is skeptical but he trusts the professor&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:29.040 --> 00:10:33.600
with his body. After the chip is implanted,&nbsp;
Sing thinks of turning it into a rice cooker,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:33.600 --> 00:10:39.280
and to his surprise, he does. Then he turns into&nbsp;
a toothpaste tube and spends the rest of the night&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:39.280 --> 00:10:44.880
like that. Now that he has superhuman powers, Sing&nbsp;
goes to impress Chung-Chung with it. He finds her&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:44.880 --> 00:10:48.960
at a restaurant having dinner with her boyfriend&nbsp;
and his parents. When she excuses herself and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:48.960 --> 00:10:53.920
goes to the bathroom, Sing follows her behind.
He claims to be a changed person and begs her to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:53.920 --> 00:10:58.400
be his girlfriend. To showcase his skills,&nbsp;
he even transforms into a strange toilet.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:01.120 --> 00:11:05.840
When Chung-Chung is still not impressed, he takes&nbsp;
over a magic show happening in the restaurant&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:05.840 --> 00:11:10.240
and shows his powers to the audience. By the&nbsp;
end of the night, he is flying in the sky with&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:10.240 --> 00:11:15.760
Chung-Chung using an umbrella as a parachute.&nbsp;
An impressed Chung-Chung agrees to date him.
&nbsp;

00:11:15.760 --> 00:11:19.920
The next day, Sing goes to the school&nbsp;
confidently. He transforms his hand&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:19.920 --> 00:11:24.720
into a water hose and teaches the students a&nbsp;
lesson for messing with him. Eventually, they&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:24.720 --> 00:11:30.640
start to obey him and turn into good students.&nbsp;
Everything goes well in Sing’s life until one day&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:30.640 --> 00:11:36.000
the gangster Mark finds out he is still alive&nbsp;
and attacks him. They get into a fight but Sing&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:36.000 --> 00:11:40.960
defeats him easily with his new powers. 
Mark’s boss Fumito is not someone who gives up&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:40.960 --> 00:11:46.880
easily. He turns Mark into a cyborg as well. But&nbsp;
he budgets the surgery with sixty million dollars&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:46.880 --> 00:11:51.360
and makes him even better than Sing. 
A few days later, Sing and Chung-Chung are&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:51.360 --> 00:11:57.040
getting married. Siu-Fu comes to the wedding but&nbsp;
Sing recognizes him as Mark in disguise. The party&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:57.040 --> 00:12:02.240
is interrupted as the two get into a fight. Mark&nbsp;
terrorizes everyone and starts firing randomly.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:02.240 --> 00:12:07.520
Amidst the chaos, he fires a special weapon&nbsp;
at Sing that kills him instantly. Everyone&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:07.520 --> 00:12:13.280
is in shock until Sing revives from his burnt&nbsp;
dead body resembling an old woman in a robe.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:13.280 --> 00:12:18.400
The professor discloses that the chip turns Sing’s&nbsp;
revenge mode on when he is defeated. Which means&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:18.400 --> 00:12:23.680
that he is now more powerful than ever. 
Sing transforms into a giant steam iron and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:23.680 --> 00:12:29.200
flattens his opponent. Following that, he&nbsp;
turns into a microwave and traps Mark inside.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:29.200 --> 00:12:34.720
The professor starts the microwave from outside&nbsp;
which melts Mark and finally kills him. In the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:34.720 --> 00:12:39.040
last scene, we see the professor hitting&nbsp;
on Sing because of his appearance as an old&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:39.040 --> 00:12:44.880
woman. Chung-Chung playfully asks her father&nbsp;
to back off because he is marrying Sing.
&nbsp;

00:12:44.880 --> 00:12:49.280
Subscribe for more videos like&nbsp;
this, turn on the notification,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:49.280 --> 00:12:52.981
and leave a like to help the channel out.&nbsp;
Thanks for watching. 

